{
	"name": "Pursuit of Victory",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/commodities/treasure/cup-trophy-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 12th level your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.ODYsXgw5q0mwxp4N]{Questing} ability improves. You now declare a quest which will take multiple days to complete, allowing you to benefit from long rests before its completion. The quest must be something you could reasonably accomplish within a week.</p><p>Each day that your quest continues, you may declare an additional quest to represent a milestone in completing your overarching quest. These smaller quests face the normal limitations and penalties of the questing class feature.</p><p>If you fail to accomplish your week long quest before the end of the 7th day, you immediately gain 3 levels of strife.</p>",
